  "body": "Sealegs Ahoy!\r\n\r\nPresenting 888sqm (more or less) of prime beachfront land opposite the boat ramp on Bucklands Beach. Occupying an impressive double-width site, this blue-chip property enjoys spectacular views across the channel to the city skyline and beyond. Located within the sought-after Macleans College zone, it offers a rare opportunity to secure an exceptional coastal position with endless potential.  \r\n\r\nOptions abound! The existing residence enjoys expansive sea views from both levels and a front-row seat to the ever-changing activity on the water. Well-presented and comfortable as it stands, it offers generous living spaces and stunning west-facing sunsets. Enjoy it as is, renovate to create a bespoke coastal retreat, or explore the potential of two exceptional residences, or one landmark waterfront home, subject to council approval.\r\n\r\nFor those who love life on the water, it doesn't get much better. With the boat ramp directly across the road, launching your next adventure is effortless. If you own a Sealegs, this exceptional location places the entire Hauraki Gulf on your doorstep, ready to become your playground.\r\n\r\nBeyond the waterfront setting, you will enjoy the convenience of Half Moon Bay Marina, ferry services to Auckland CBD and Waiheke Island, beachside cafés and eateries, and a host of everyday amenities close at hand. Enjoy scenic coastal walks, nearby beaches, and everything this vibrant seaside community has to offer.\r\n\r\nWhether you choose to renovate, redevelop, or simply secure a substantial beachfront landholding, properties offering this level of position, scale, and potential are rarely available.\r\n\r\nTrades will be considered.\r\n\r\nWe invite you to visit our open homes or contact us to arrange a private viewing.\r\n\r\nPlease note some images are AI-generated artist impressions intended to illustrate the potential of the property. They do not represent approved plans or future development outcomes.",
